---
source: crates/splot-cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(\"encode\")"
---
Encode a Y4M file to an AV2 IVF stream

Usage: splot encode [OPTIONS] --output <OUTPUT> <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  Input Y4M file, or `-` for standard input

Options:
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>    Output IVF file
  -v, --verbose...         Increase logging verbosity (repeatable: -v, -vv, -vvv)
      --qp <QP>            Constant quantizer (`base_q_idx`), 1..=255 [default: 80]
      --quiet              Silence all logging except errors
      --preset <PRESET>    Speed preset: 0 is the slowest and best, 10 the fastest [default: 6]
      --threads <THREADS>  Worker-thread policy: `auto` (default), a positive integer, or `0` (alias for auto) [default: auto]
      --limit <LIMIT>      Stop after this many input frames
      --keyint <KEYINT>    Distance between key frames, in frames [default: 120]
      --stats              Print `frame,pts,qp,bits,psnr_y,psnr_u,psnr_v` CSV lines to stdout
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
